_pdbx_database_remark.id     999 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE 
Ser 65 is mutated to Gly, Tyr 66 is mutated to Ser. 
Peptide bond at position 65-66 is broken and the 
C-terminus of residue 65 is decarboxylated forming NME. 
Residue S66 underwent side chain dehydration to create 
dehydroalanine moiety. 
;
